{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 995016,
  "courseSlug": "vuejs-2-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Vue - The Complete Guide (incl. Router & Composition API)",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879454",
      "title": "Playing CSS Animations with Vue's Help",
      "lectureOrder": 197,
      "videoOrder": 172,
      "sourceHash": "128d6d8f2d79efccd823d39b0cb32d2423aa0445e55ffc07ddd144697d073b60",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.31,
          "end": 3.88,
          "en": "And I will show this to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.88,
          "end": 7.59,
          "en": "by going to App.vue, and there I'll add a new div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.59,
          "end": 8.98,
          "en": "I'll come back to the modal later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.98,
          "end": 10.81,
          "en": "but I wanna start with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.81,
          "end": 12.97,
          "en": "Give it a class of container,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.97,
          "end": 17.237,
          "en": "and in there, let's just add a regular button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.237,
          "end": 21.83,
          "en": "\"Toggle Paragraph\" could be the text we have on the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.83,
          "end": 26.377,
          "en": "And then I'll add a little a paragraph above that button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.377,
          "end": 29.4,
          "en": "\"This is only sometimes visible...\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.4,
          "end": 31.64,
          "en": "and this paragraph should be toggled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.64,
          "end": 33.253,
          "en": "whenever this button is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.32,
          "end": 36.2,
          "en": "Now, you know how that works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.2,
          "end": 39.163,
          "en": "We can add a new data property, paraIsVisible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.62,
          "end": 43.09,
          "en": "which initially is false, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.09,
          "end": 46.48,
          "en": "We can add a new method anywhere in the methods key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.48,
          "end": 50.13,
          "en": "toggleParagraph, could be the name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.13,
          "end": 52.46,
          "en": "and in that method we now control this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.46,
          "end": 54.68,
          "en": "newly added data property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.68,
          "end": 58.32,
          "en": "So we set, paraIsVisible, to what it's currently not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.32,
          "end": 60.123,
          "en": "to invert its value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.47,
          "end": 65.26,
          "en": "And then we can use paraIsVisible with, v if,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.26,
          "end": 68.193,
          "en": "to only sometimes show that paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.35,
          "end": 73.1,
          "en": "And the only remaining step now is to wire up this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.1,
          "end": 76.393,
          "en": "with a click listener pointing at, toggleParagraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.08,
          "end": 81.87,
          "en": "And if we do that, well, we have that paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.87,
          "end": 85.09,
          "en": "which instantly appears and instantly disappears.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.09,
          "end": 87.07,
          "en": "Now let's animate both and let's see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.07,
          "end": 88.473,
          "en": "how Vue helps us there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.37,
          "end": 91.1,
          "en": "There is a built in component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.1,
          "end": 93.63,
          "en": "which you can wrap around the elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.63,
          "end": 95.85,
          "en": "where you wanna control the appearance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.85,
          "end": 98.41,
          "en": "and removal animation with Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.41,
          "end": 100.65299999999999,
          "en": "And that's the transition component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.59,
          "end": 104.3,
          "en": "You can wrap the element, which should be animated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.3,
          "end": 106.42,
          "en": "with transition, and of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.42,
          "end": 108.41,
          "en": "you can wrap multiple elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.41,
          "end": 111.47999999999999,
          "en": "per Vue app and per Vue component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.47999999999999,
          "end": 114.47,
          "en": "and transition, this built in component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.47,
          "end": 118.00999999999999,
          "en": "will then manipulate this wrapped element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.00999999999999,
          "end": 121.84,
          "en": "Important, transition must only contain one element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.84,
          "end": 123.55,
          "en": "one direct child.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.55,
          "end": 126.54,
          "en": "There is an exception about which I'll talk later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.54,
          "end": 128.17,
          "en": "but for the moment, keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.17,
          "end": 131.693,
          "en": "that you must only have one direct child in transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 132.89,
          "end": 137.05,
          "en": "And what does transition do with that wrapped element now?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 137.05,
          "end": 138.98,
          "en": "Well, it's this wrapped element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 138.98,
          "end": 141.84,
          "en": "which at some point of time is mounted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 141.84,
          "end": 143.89,
          "en": "but which of course in this case also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 143.89,
          "end": 146.03,
          "en": "is not mounted initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 146.03,
          "end": 148.173,
          "en": "It's not always visible on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.37,
          "end": 152.38,
          "en": "Transition now adds a couple of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 152.38,
          "end": 156.09,
          "en": "CSS utility classes to that element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 156.09,
          "end": 159.12,
          "en": "It adds a enter-from class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 159.12,
          "end": 162.81,
          "en": "an enter-active class, and a enter-to class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 162.81,
          "end": 167.36,
          "en": "And it adds enter-from first, enter-active at the same time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 167.36,
          "end": 170.85,
          "en": "then it removes from, but enter-active stays on the element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.85,
          "end": 175.18,
          "en": "and enter-to is added, right when the animation finishes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 175.18,
          "end": 178.85,
          "en": "And Vue finds out how long that process should take",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.85,
          "end": 182.02,
          "en": "by analyzing these special CSS classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.02,
          "end": 185.65,
          "en": "and looking for transitions and animations inside of them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 185.65,
          "end": 188.93,
          "en": "to then read the duration from them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 188.93,
          "end": 191.5,
          "en": "So Vue will analyze your CSS code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.5,
          "end": 194.59,
          "en": "for these special CSS class names.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.59,
          "end": 196.38,
          "en": "Find out the duration,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 196.38,
          "end": 201.38,
          "en": "then actually add those CSS classes over the duration.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 201.61,
          "end": 203.75,
          "en": "And that in turn will allow you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 203.75,
          "end": 207.56,
          "en": "to set different styles during that appear,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 207.56,
          "end": 210.363,
          "en": "during that entering phase of the element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 211.52,
          "end": 212.54,
          "en": "And of course you have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 212.54,
          "end": 215.1,
          "en": "a similar concept for removing elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 215.1,
          "end": 216.88,
          "en": "So when an element is mounted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 216.88,
          "end": 218.91,
          "en": "and now is not mounted anymore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 218.91,
          "end": 222.37,
          "en": "because with v if, the condition turns false,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 222.37,
          "end": 225.37,
          "en": "then Vue adds a leave-from class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 225.37,
          "end": 228.57999999999998,
          "en": "and at the same time, a leave-active class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.57999999999998,
          "end": 230.67000000000002,
          "en": "then it removes the leave-from class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 230.67000000000002,
          "end": 232.36,
          "en": "and adds a leave-to class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 232.36,
          "end": 236.89,
          "en": "and this allows you to animate the removal of elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 236.89,
          "end": 238.78,
          "en": "And the important thing again is that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 238.78,
          "end": 242.88,
          "en": "Vue will analyze the CSS code you write for these classes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 242.88,
          "end": 245.79,
          "en": "it will read the duration of the transitions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 245.79,
          "end": 248.36,
          "en": "and animations you define in those classes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 248.36,
          "end": 250.12,
          "en": "and then, and that's the key thing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 250.12,
          "end": 254.36,
          "en": "it will only really remove the element from the dom",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 254.36,
          "end": 256.73,
          "en": "once that duration is over.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 256.73,
          "end": 260.2,
          "en": "And that's the key difference to the non-Vue behavior,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 260.2,
          "end": 263.011,
          "en": "their elements are instantly added and removed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 263.011,
          "end": 265.47,
          "en": "with the transition component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 265.47,
          "end": 269.76,
          "en": "and these special CSS classes Vue will add and look for,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 269.76,
          "end": 273.44,
          "en": "Vue is able to tell that an animation has taken place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 273.44,
          "end": 276.09000000000003,
          "en": "and how long that animation takes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 276.09000000000003,
          "end": 278.62,
          "en": "and it then only removes the element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 278.62,
          "end": 281.35,
          "en": "once that animation is done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 281.35,
          "end": 282.53,
          "en": "Now that's the theory.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 282.53,
          "end": 283.983,
          "en": "Let's see it in practice.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
